<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 143 MLN BONDS AT OUTRIGHT.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 143 MLN BONDS AT OUTRIGHT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 96 million zlotys of two-year bonds, against a 231 million zloty offer and for 47 million zlotys of five-year bonds against a 199 million zloty offer at the central bank outright sale, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
